    "name": "Nippon Dojo",
    "steam_appid": 3736130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736130/extras/8d3e842e0247d73d71f4fcb27baba70a.avif?t=1751492507\" width=250 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn how to read your favorite Japanese Manga?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or have a trip to Japan planned and want to impress your friends!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey into an immersive playful world with two friendly Japanese Shiba Pups as they guide you on your way to Japanese Hiragana and Katakana Proficiency!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Study the specific Japanese character group sheet you want to focus on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Chose your preferred mini game (Pop It!) or (Fetch It!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Master and Win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the faster you learn Hiragana and Katakana! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you at the Dojo! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember. NEVER BE GAME OVER\u2122</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736130/extras/8d3e842e0247d73d71f4fcb27baba70a.avif?t=1751492507\" width=250 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to learn how to read your favorite Japanese Manga?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or have a trip to Japan planned and want to impress your friends!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey into an immersive playful world with two friendly Japanese Shiba Pups as they guide you on your way to Japanese Hiragana and Katakana Proficiency!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Study the specific Japanese character group sheet you want to focus on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Chose your preferred mini game (Pop It!) or (Fetch It!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Master and Win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you play, the faster you learn Hiragana and Katakana! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you at the Dojo! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember. NEVER BE GAME OVER\u2122</p>",
